WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.766 --> 00:00:06.233
The semifinals of the Pokémon Showcase Master Class are about to begin.

2
00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:10.000
And Serena will be competing along with Shauna and Jessilee.

3
00:00:10.066 --> 00:00:14.700
Who will win this decisive round and challenge Aria, the Kalos Queen?

4
00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:17.100
Two more wins and she's Kalos Queen.

5
00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:18.800
- Pika!
- Oh!

6
00:00:18.866 --> 00:00:22.466
I wish this was over because it feels like my heart is going to burst.

7
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:24.300
You're not even competing.

8
00:00:24.366 --> 00:00:26.400
- Take a deep breath.
- Right.

9
00:00:26.466 --> 00:00:29.533
Jesse. Meowth. Gourgeist. Courage.

10
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.900
Remember all that rigorous training.

11
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:33.500
Transform it into a win.

12
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:36.266
During the semi-final round, our three performers

13
00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:39.433
will engage in a Freestyle Performance using two Pokémon.

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.966
I just have to do what I do. Simple.

15
00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:44.200
Gourgeist.

16
00:00:44.266 --> 00:00:47.200
Serena, let's get out there and show our skills.

17
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:48.800
Right.

18
00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:53.000
Alors, we now begin the semifinal round.

19
00:00:59.366 --> 00:01:02.666
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

20
00:01:03.366 --> 00:01:06.300
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

21
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.366
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

22
00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:13.433
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

23
00:01:13.566 --> 00:01:14.600
♪ Gotta catch 'em all!

24
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:18.000
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

25
00:01:18.066 --> 00:01:21.100
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

26
00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:22.633
♪ Gotta catch 'em all! ♪

27
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.533
Performing a Pathway to the Future.

28
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.566
And we are off.

29
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:39.200
Will we see tears of happiness or tears of sorrow, or both?

30
00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:41.333
Only one performer moves on.

31
00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:43.600
First up, Jessilee.

32
00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:48.433
Use Leech Seed.

33
00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:56.366
And the winner...

34
00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.966
Why, that's me.

35
00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.433
Gourgeist.

36
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.966
Now use Seed Bomb.

37
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.200
Meowth, use Fury Swipes.

38
00:02:11.266 --> 00:02:12.133
Got it.

39
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:19.033
And finished.

40
00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:21.866
Wow!
Perfect.

41
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:28.233
Next up, we have the lovely Shauna.

42
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:31.333
Get ready for a dazzling performance.

43
00:02:33.633 --> 00:02:36.066
Now, Ivysaur, use Vine Whip.

44
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.666
And Flabébé, use Fairy Wind.

45
00:02:48.566 --> 00:02:50.233
Now use Vine Whip.

46
00:02:57.533 --> 00:02:59.100
Use Solar Beam.

47
00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:00.900
Use Moonblast.

48
00:03:06.933 --> 00:03:09.166
We're finished.

49
00:03:09.233 --> 00:03:10.400
Nice job, Shauna.

50
00:03:10.466 --> 00:03:12.000
Shauna's so cool.

51
00:03:12.366 --> 00:03:16.300
One tiny little mistake can really end up costing you a lot in a round like this.

52
00:03:16.866 --> 00:03:19.033
And last but not least,

53
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:22.366
our last performance before the finalist is chosen.

54
00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.733
All right, let's see her in action. Welcome, Serena.

55
00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.100
Go, Serena!

56
00:03:30.166 --> 00:03:31.900
- Pika!
- Yeah!

57
00:03:33.866 --> 00:03:35.466
If I can just stay calm...

58
00:03:39.533 --> 00:03:40.700
Now, Sylveon.

59
00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.300
Swift, let's go.

60
00:03:49.766 --> 00:03:51.233
Pancham, use Stone Edge.

61
00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.900
Pancham, pancham, cham!

62
00:04:22.966 --> 00:04:24.266
We're all done.

63
00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.266
Thanks for that, Sylveon.

64
00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.900
- Serena was great.
- Pika!

65
00:04:34.966 --> 00:04:36.133
She'll win. She'll win.

66
00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.566
Brilliant. And all at the crucial time.

67
00:04:42.566 --> 00:04:45.866
Now time to cast your votes for the semifinal round.

68
00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.833
Do that by using your Glow Casters.

69
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.633
For our television viewers,

70
00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:54.366
please press the button that corresponds to your favorite performer.

71
00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.166
- Ready? Cast your votes.
- Yeah!

72
00:04:58.233 --> 00:04:59.100
We're off.

73
00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:15.066
Out of our final three, a single performer is now being chosen

74
00:05:15.133 --> 00:05:17.733
who will challenge Aria, the Kalos Queen.

75
00:05:21.166 --> 00:05:23.166
Serena, you've done it.

76
00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:25.466
We won.

77
00:05:26.366 --> 00:05:27.200
We won.

78
00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:28.766
We did it.

79
00:05:30.233 --> 00:05:32.300
You were great. Thanks, you two.

80
00:05:32.366 --> 00:05:33.833
You did it, Serena.

81
00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:37.500
- I'm so happy for you.
- I feel like I'm in a dream.

82
00:05:37.933 --> 00:05:40.733
She was great. I knew that she could do it.

83
00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:44.366
Hey, that girl is my daughter and I'm so proud of her.

84
00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.466
- Oi, vey!
- Gourgeist!

85
00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.333
Oh, well, I made it this far.

86
00:05:54.966 --> 00:05:57.600
Now Kalos knows what a beauty I am.

87
00:05:57.766 --> 00:05:59.000
Not too shabby.

88
00:06:00.633 --> 00:06:04.100
Congratulations, Serena. Will you hold onto my dream?

89
00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.766
If you don't mind.

90
00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.033
Shauna.

91
00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:10.633
I'd be lying if I said I'm not upset, but...

92
00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:16.433
Do your very best, for all our sakes.

93
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.133
Because you were the best of all of us.

94
00:06:20.266 --> 00:06:21.266
Mm-hm.

95
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:26.433
Please wait here. We'll call you when it's time.

96
00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:27.933
Right.

97
00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:39.766
It's all right. There's no need to worry at all.

98
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:41.233
- Huh?

99
00:06:42.533 --> 00:06:43.700
Yes? Come in.

100
00:06:47.266 --> 00:06:48.700
Huh?

101
00:06:50.133 --> 00:06:52.466
- Show me. Come on.
- Huh?

102
00:06:52.533 --> 00:06:53.400
Your wrist.

103
00:06:54.033 --> 00:06:55.500
But how did you know?

104
00:06:55.566 --> 00:06:57.133
By how you were moving.

105
00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:03.533
I see you can barely make a fist. You'll need to forfeit the finals.

106
00:07:03.766 --> 00:07:06.400
You can't put on a proper performance like this.

107
00:07:07.233 --> 00:07:08.933
Much less defeat Aria.

108
00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.266
Forfeit?

109
00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:15.533
But this is our big dream.

110
00:07:17.066 --> 00:07:21.900
I had no real ambitions, but I finally have one with my Pokémon.

111
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:26.533
We've made it this far. I don't wanna stop till it's over.

112
00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.100
I don't wanna stop till it's over.

113
00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:32.733
Seriously.

114
00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:34.966
You two are so much alike.

115
00:07:35.966 --> 00:07:37.666
Just one performance.

116
00:07:38.033 --> 00:07:42.366
I can make it hold until then. But have a doctor look at it afterward.

117
00:07:43.033 --> 00:07:45.433
Promise that you'll do that. All right?

118
00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.633
Mm-hm!

119
00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:47.533
Yes.

120
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:50.933
And now we come to the moment

121
00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.700
where the hallowed title of Kalos Queen is up for grabs and on the line.

122
00:07:54.766 --> 00:07:57.966
The performers may use as many Pokémon as they want.

123
00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.100
Let's wish them both well. To great performances!

124
00:08:02.433 --> 00:08:05.566
The final round is between Serena, the challenger...

125
00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.400
and our reigning Kalos Queen, Aria.

126
00:08:15.233 --> 00:08:16.333
That look...

127
00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:19.966
There's no need to hold back against someone who's that determined for sure.

128
00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:25.800
When all is said and done, who will be Kalos Queen?

129
00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.900
Let us begin with challenger Serena's performance.

130
00:08:30.933 --> 00:08:32.266
You can do it, Serena.

131
00:08:32.366 --> 00:08:33.633
Win it, Serena.

132
00:08:33.933 --> 00:08:35.666
You've just gotta beat Aria.

133
00:08:39.799 --> 00:08:40.766
Here goes.

134
00:08:40.933 --> 00:08:44.733
She knows she's performing for all of us, too. So, she'd better win.

135
00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.600
She can do it. I just know.

136
00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.200
All ready?

137
00:09:03.533 --> 00:09:05.566
Braixen, use Flamethrower.

138
00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:07.900
Pancham, use Dark Pulse.

139
00:09:07.966 --> 00:09:08.966
- Braixen!
- Cham!

140
00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:10.666
Braixen!

141
00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:13.100
Pancham!

142
00:09:13.933 --> 00:09:16.200
Sylveon, use Swift.

143
00:09:21.566 --> 00:09:22.566
Braixen!

144
00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.066
Braix...

145
00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:31.966
Go, Serena!

146
00:09:32.033 --> 00:09:35.633
- Pancham. Braixen. Sylveon. Go!
- You're doing great.

147
00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.833
Here we go.

148
00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.333
Pancham!

149
00:10:01.533 --> 00:10:02.700
Braixen!

150
00:10:10.633 --> 00:10:12.133
Finished. Yeah.

151
00:10:14.666 --> 00:10:17.166
I did everything I possibly could.

152
00:10:18.533 --> 00:10:20.566
Who's that Pokémon?

153
00:10:25.433 --> 00:10:27.333
It's Aromatisse.

154
00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.500
Aromatisse!

155
00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:35.900
And now, defending her title of Kalos Queen,

156
00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.066
please welcome Aria.

157
00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.066
Of course, I have no intention of losing either.

158
00:10:47.433 --> 00:10:49.933
All right, Delphox, Mystical Fire.

159
00:10:50.033 --> 00:10:52.200
Vivillon, use Psybeam.

160
00:10:58.266 --> 00:11:00.066
Aromatisse, use Reflect.

161
00:11:00.533 --> 00:11:02.066
Aromatisse!

162
00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:15.733
She gives such an awesome performance.

163
00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.433
Her smile brings everyone such strength and joy.

164
00:11:21.433 --> 00:11:25.966
Funny. I'm always the one getting strength from everybody else.

165
00:11:30.766 --> 00:11:32.400
And that's all.

166
00:11:32.466 --> 00:11:33.500
Awesome.

167
00:11:33.566 --> 00:11:34.566
Pika!

168
00:11:34.633 --> 00:11:36.033
No surprise there.

169
00:11:36.466 --> 00:11:39.700
So, these two lovely and talented ladies

170
00:11:39.766 --> 00:11:42.033
have finished their exciting performances.

171
00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.266
Grab your Glow Casters and get ready to cast your votes.

172
00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.533
Everybody ready to go?

173
00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:55.033
- Un, deux, trois!
- Pika!

174
00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.100
Go!

175
00:11:57.333 --> 00:11:59.800
Will a new Kalos Queen be crowned?

176
00:12:00.466 --> 00:12:04.633
Or will the reigning queen hold onto her current status?

177
00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.333
The fateful moment of decision is now.

178
00:12:20.666 --> 00:12:24.666
The revered title of Kalos Queen belongs to...

179
00:12:25.333 --> 00:12:27.500
Performer Aria.

180
00:12:27.566 --> 00:12:30.733
The reigning queen has defended her crown.

181
00:12:31.433 --> 00:12:33.266
Oh, no. Aria won.

182
00:12:33.333 --> 00:12:36.200
Serena did the best she could. She was great.

183
00:12:36.266 --> 00:12:38.833
And she's still got a dream to hold on to.

184
00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:39.766
Right.

185
00:12:43.633 --> 00:12:47.366
And with her brilliant performance, Aria is still Kalos Queen.

186
00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:49.666
Klefki, her tiara, please.

187
00:12:50.833 --> 00:12:52.266
Klefki!

188
00:12:59.233 --> 00:13:01.200
Aria sure is amazing.

189
00:13:01.266 --> 00:13:02.566
Braixen.

190
00:13:04.533 --> 00:13:05.833
Cham, pancham.

191
00:13:09.633 --> 00:13:10.466
Serena?

192
00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:14.466
Wow, that was fun. Let's perform together again sometime.

193
00:13:18.533 --> 00:13:20.866
Great. I'm gonna keep working hard.

194
00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:23.733
And pretty soon I'll become Kalos Queen.

195
00:13:23.866 --> 00:13:25.266
Then bring it on.

196
00:13:28.366 --> 00:13:30.600
And that concludes our Master Class.

197
00:13:30.766 --> 00:13:32.166
Until the next time.

198
00:13:32.433 --> 00:13:35.266
When we discover who will be the next performer

199
00:13:35.333 --> 00:13:38.300
to challenge our Kalos Queen Aria.

200
00:13:38.533 --> 00:13:43.266
So, until we all gather around this beautiful and exciting stage once again,

201
00:13:43.333 --> 00:13:44.266
au revoir.

202
00:13:45.766 --> 00:13:47.766
There. You'll be fine.

203
00:13:47.966 --> 00:13:50.533
- Just take it easy and don't overdo it.
- Right.

204
00:13:50.966 --> 00:13:52.733
- Take care.
- Thanks, doctor.

205
00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.666
- Huh?
- How do you feel?

206
00:13:57.933 --> 00:14:00.666
I'm feeling fine now. Thank you so--

207
00:14:00.733 --> 00:14:03.433
Don't ever push yourself like that again.

208
00:14:03.866 --> 00:14:06.000
Especially if you want to beat Aria.

209
00:14:06.066 --> 00:14:06.933
Huh?

210
00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:09.400
Yes, you're right.

211
00:14:10.366 --> 00:14:13.166
You said I couldn't beat Aria.

212
00:14:13.366 --> 00:14:15.000
I remember it exactly.

213
00:14:16.666 --> 00:14:18.966
Something Aria has that I don't.

214
00:14:20.033 --> 00:14:23.966
I think I know now what that is after watching her performance just now.

215
00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:25.700
I have lots to learn.

216
00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:29.800
My friends and Pokémon are always the ones who are there supporting me.

217
00:14:31.133 --> 00:14:32.366
Aria has a gift.

218
00:14:32.833 --> 00:14:34.233
She makes people smile.

219
00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:37.866
And she once gave me advice even though she didn't know me.

220
00:14:37.933 --> 00:14:39.266
She's a giving person.

221
00:14:40.266 --> 00:14:43.133
I know I've been on the receiving end until now.

222
00:14:43.633 --> 00:14:47.933
But I wanna become queen so I can give back to everybody else, too.

223
00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.866
I wanna give people strength, make them smile, give good advice,

224
00:14:52.333 --> 00:14:53.766
even give tough love.

225
00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:57.666
That means I've got to work so much harder.

226
00:14:57.833 --> 00:14:59.733
So, I can be a good queen.

227
00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:01.833
Hmm...

228
00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:05.733
Now that you realize that, you'll become an even better performer.

229
00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.366
Huh?

230
00:15:07.433 --> 00:15:09.133
Would you like to learn with me?

231
00:15:11.133 --> 00:15:12.833
What are you talking about?

232
00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:16.366
I'll teach you everything about being a performer.

233
00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:21.733
You don't have to answer right now. Give it some thought and let me know.

234
00:15:32.733 --> 00:15:35.400
- Smoochum!
- Cham! Cham, cham!

235
00:15:35.466 --> 00:15:37.900
Wow, Serena, you were so close.

236
00:15:38.033 --> 00:15:41.400
Yeah, all of you put your faith in me, but I lost.

237
00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.666
What are you talking about? For us, it's a brand-new start.

238
00:15:44.733 --> 00:15:45.566
You see...

239
00:15:45.633 --> 00:15:48.366
I'm going to come up with lots of new performance routines.

240
00:15:48.433 --> 00:15:50.066
They're gonna knock your socks off

241
00:15:50.133 --> 00:15:52.233
All my losing days are over.

242
00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.500
Yeah, mine, too.

243
00:15:53.966 --> 00:15:55.600
- And...
- Huh?

244
00:15:55.666 --> 00:15:57.200
There's you-know-who.

245
00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.033
- Huh?
- Pika?

246
00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.566
Miette!

247
00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.600
See you later.

248
00:16:02.833 --> 00:16:04.266
Take care, Ash.

249
00:16:04.666 --> 00:16:06.000
Yeah, you too, Miette.

250
00:16:06.233 --> 00:16:07.833
See you on stage again.

251
00:16:08.266 --> 00:16:09.566
Let's go, Smoochum.

252
00:16:10.133 --> 00:16:13.066
Smoochum!

253
00:16:13.133 --> 00:16:15.100
Later. Take care.

254
00:16:16.133 --> 00:16:18.733
Bye. Hi to Tierno and Trevor for me.

255
00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:19.700
Bye-bye.

256
00:16:19.766 --> 00:16:21.233
Take care of yourself.

257
00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.600
- So, James...
- Oi, vey!

258
00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.266
know what I think?

259
00:16:29.533 --> 00:16:30.900
Let's have a feast.

260
00:16:31.266 --> 00:16:34.000
- You're not off the rails?
- Of course not.

261
00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.966
I was able to make it this far because of you.

262
00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.800
It makes me want to sing.

263
00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.066
Whoa! What do you know?

264
00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:43.600
Jessie!

265
00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.766
- What's wrong with you?
- We'll follow you, Jessie.

266
00:16:47.833 --> 00:16:50.866
- The feast is on your wallet.
- With pleasure.

267
00:16:50.933 --> 00:16:52.400
I'll pay the tip.

268
00:16:54.866 --> 00:17:00.433
- I tried, but I came up a bit short.
- What matters is you did your very best.

269
00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:03.766
Now you simply move towards your next goal.

270
00:17:03.833 --> 00:17:04.933
Mm-hm.

271
00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.433
Hmm.

272
00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.666
I've gotta scoot. Rhyhorn's waiting for me.

273
00:17:11.099 --> 00:17:11.933
But, Mom.

274
00:17:12.533 --> 00:17:13.933
- Hmm?
- Uh...

275
00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:17.700
It's nothing.

276
00:17:18.099 --> 00:17:19.466
Right. Bye.

277
00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:21.800
Bye-bye.

278
00:17:21.866 --> 00:17:23.633
- Have a safe trip.
- Take care.

279
00:17:34.166 --> 00:17:35.866
What's wrong? Does it hurt?

280
00:17:36.033 --> 00:17:38.800
Oh, no. I've been sitting here thinking.

281
00:17:39.366 --> 00:17:41.066
Yeah, I'll bet you were thinking

282
00:17:41.133 --> 00:17:43.433
about your next performance, weren't you?

283
00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:46.466
- Mm-hm. You could say that.
- Of course.

284
00:17:46.633 --> 00:17:50.566
When I lose a battle, I get so excited about what I'm gonna do next time.

285
00:17:50.633 --> 00:17:53.700
My next strategy. Then I know I'm gonna win.

286
00:17:53.766 --> 00:17:56.633
It's great you're always so positive, Ash.

287
00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.633
- Huh?
- Pikachu.

288
00:18:01.166 --> 00:18:03.733
It all seems to come so naturally for you.

289
00:18:04.533 --> 00:18:05.533
Braixen.

290
00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.300
Seriously? I don't always know what to do.

291
00:18:08.366 --> 00:18:09.200
Huh?

292
00:18:09.633 --> 00:18:10.466
But then...

293
00:18:13.066 --> 00:18:15.933
if I really think about it, I'd rather do stuff.

294
00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.633
'Cause even if I goof up, I learn something.

295
00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.266
There's nothing we could ever do that's a waste of time.

296
00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:22.233
Oh, Ash.

297
00:18:23.333 --> 00:18:25.733
Okay, time to hit the sack.

298
00:18:26.133 --> 00:18:28.766
- We've got an early morning tomorrow.
- Yeah.

299
00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.366
Miss Palermo?

300
00:18:46.066 --> 00:18:47.766
My, you're up early.

301
00:18:48.366 --> 00:18:50.200
I hope you're here to say yes.

302
00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:55.133
Thank you. Your offer has made me really happy.

303
00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.233
I just can't go with you right now.

304
00:18:59.833 --> 00:19:01.000
I'm sorry.

305
00:19:01.733 --> 00:19:05.233
Dear. Why not? I think it's a great opportunity for you.

306
00:19:05.766 --> 00:19:08.133
I know I should accept it without a second thought,

307
00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.233
but I don't think it's right to go with you

308
00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:12.466
and then leave Ash and the others behind.

309
00:19:12.733 --> 00:19:15.966
It kind of feels like it wouldn't be the right thing to do.

310
00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.666
They're your friends?

311
00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.033
Mm-hm.

312
00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:21.533
In the beginning, my journey was just me

313
00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.266
looking for an excuse to get out of my house.

314
00:19:26.066 --> 00:19:31.200
But after becoming a performer... and meeting my rivals...

315
00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.566
and Aria...

316
00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:37.533
I wanted to learn everything.

317
00:19:37.966 --> 00:19:40.066
Everything about being a performer.

318
00:19:40.133 --> 00:19:42.233
- Braixen!
- Pancham.

319
00:19:43.566 --> 00:19:46.133
I need to make it through my journey first.

320
00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.633
And then when I've finally gotten to that point, I'll be ready.

321
00:19:55.666 --> 00:19:59.933
All right. Keep on your journey to your heart's content.

322
00:20:00.366 --> 00:20:04.433
And once you're all ready for the next step, you just give me a call.

323
00:20:16.933 --> 00:20:18.900
All right, Ash, you're up next.

324
00:20:18.966 --> 00:20:20.766
Yeah, the Snowbelle Gym.

325
00:20:20.933 --> 00:20:23.433
- I'm gonna train hard and win.
- Pika!

326
00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:26.166
And you know that we're here for you all the way.

327
00:20:26.233 --> 00:20:28.366
You're super-excited, aren't you?

328
00:20:28.433 --> 00:20:30.500
- You bet.
- Pika!

329
00:20:30.566 --> 00:20:33.700
Yeah. And I'll keep moving forward, too.

330
00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:35.766
Although Serena put on

331
00:20:35.833 --> 00:20:38.000
a spectacular performance in the Master Class,

332
00:20:38.066 --> 00:20:40.066
she fell short of defeating Aria.

333
00:20:40.466 --> 00:20:42.466
But her future is looking bright.

334
00:20:42.533 --> 00:20:45.566
Her road to becoming Kalos Queen still lies ahead

335
00:20:45.866 --> 00:20:48.033
as the journey continues.
